{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的大块直接交代人物处境、原因和转折，单看大字也更容易串起人物线；X 的高亮词虽然抓住了重点，但单独看时部分关系不够清楚。small、fine：Y 的感受更贴着对应的话句，而且更多落在胸口发紧、腿脚发虚、被惊醒等具体的观众体验上；X 的感受有不少转去描写和弦、琶音、旋律本身。core、concise：两版都保留了尊严与怀念的反复拉扯，X 对受过的委屈不能当作没发生、以及继续生活的行动线交代得稍完整，但两版都有话与感受互相复述的地方，差距不够判胜；human：两边都有个别生硬搭配，Y 的“心脏以最高负荷”“原地的停滞里”不自然，X 的“心里的愿望向远方发出”“只凭这点指望回去忍让”也不够口语。load：X 的高亮短语明显更短，尤其 S08、S10—S12 这些短停留屏，Y 的整块大字需要扫读的文字更多；不过综合大字理解效果和感受质量，仍然是 Y 更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8fb5f157-5530-443f-b965-b0780e2ec1ee", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T144737431423Z", "elapsed_seconds": 342.234, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T14:53:19.686112+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c4e27a45e0d4ad597c812c13a27c34ebc043412a64c8b08f8d9e906af89f033a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de